  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s56",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___ 05:59AM BLOOD Calcium-8.9 Phos-4.4 Mg-2.___ with CHF (EF ___, CAD, large ventral hernia, afib on \ncoumadin, presents from ___ with hypoxia and \ntachycardia, found to be in decompensated systolic CHF and Afib \nwith RVR.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=6167-6389",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s57",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Acute exacerbation of systolic CHF.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=6392-6429",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s58",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She presented grossly \nvolume overloaded with elevated JVP, dependent edema, BNP 19000, \nand hypoxia.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=6430-6531",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s59",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "This was exacerbated by moderate TR and MR with \nuncontrolled a-fib with RVR.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=6532-6609",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s60",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Loss of atrial kick and rapid rate \nwas impairing her overall cardiac output.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=6610-6687",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s61",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was initially \nhypotensive and admitted to the MICU, but given goals of care, \nshe was managed medically.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=6688-6797",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s62",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Aggressive diuresis, IV dopamine, \ncentral lines, non-invasive ventilation were all not indicated \nwithin patient's goals of care per the patient's son who is the \nhealthcare proxy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=6798-6979",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s63",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The goal of CHF treatment will be to \nfacilitate comfort.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=6980-7037",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s64",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was uptitrated to metoprolol 25mg po \ntid.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=7038-7084",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s65",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was continued on furosemide 40mg daily.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=7085-7128",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s66",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "#  Atrial fibrillation.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=7130-7153",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s67",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Inadequate rate control on admission.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=7154-7191",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s68",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Improved with uptitration of metoprolol.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12107928-DS-12:chars=7193-7233",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:PR:s69",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "PR",
